#: CHANGELOG.md:14
msgid "The DVR series scan must not block the scheduler, and four more audit findings (#50)"
msgstr "Der DVR-Serienscan darf den Scheduler nicht blockieren, und vier weitere Prüfungsbefunde (#50)"

